{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212410","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121241001:0":{"text":"알파 일레븐! 왜 도망친 거야?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一！你为什么逃走？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EE90592E5B7D3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121241002:0":{"text":"질문하는 사람이 너무 많아서 불편했어.","source_cn":"那里提问的人太多了，我很不自在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38AA0ABC034F5A7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121241003:0":{"text":"치료를 위해 네 상태를 물어보는 건 당연한 거라고! 다들 널 걱정하는 거지, 고문하는 게 아니야!","source_cn":"真是的……要给你治病，总得问清楚病状吧？大家是在关心你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8422DE7FF23D49E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121241004:0":{"text":"이 골짜기가 얼마나 위험한데! 어서 우리랑 돌아가자.","source_cn":"这片山谷很危险，赶紧跟我们回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E38797431B5A6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121241005:0":{"text":"잠깐만, 이 파란 꽃이 뭔지 알고 싶어. 내 꿈속에서 본 적이 있거든.","source_cn":"等等，我想知道这片蓝色的花朵是什么？它们在我的梦中出现过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3A96C93DCBB270","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121241006:0":{"text":"꽃? 아, 이건 이블플라워야.","source_cn":"花？哦，你说这些魔花啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F401AAB6238A2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121241007:0":{"text":"시간이 조금 더 지나면 이블플라워는 빛나는 꽃이라는 생물로 자라게 돼.","source_cn":"大约再过两个落叶季，它们会长成名为荧荧花的生物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C29F2F9C64FE71E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1121241007":{"text":"시간이 조금 더 지나면 이블플라워는 빛나는 꽃이라는 생물로 자라게 돼.","source_cn":"大约再过两个落叶季，它们会长成名为荧荧花的生物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C29F2F9C64FE71E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121241008:0":{"text":"네, 처음 들어보세요? 땅거미 숲에 마법사님께서 탐험해야 할 게 아직 많이 남아 있는 것 같네요.","source_cn":"是哦，你第一次听说吗？看来薄暮丛林仍有很多事值得你去探...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5A375207553366E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네, 처음 들어보세요? 땅거미 숲에 마법사님께서 탐험해야 할 게 아직 많이 남아 있는 것 같네요.","female":"네, 처음 들어보세요? 땅거미 숲에 마법사님께서 탐험해야 할 게 아직 많이 남아 있는 것 같네요.","variant_male_record_index":"117312","variant_female_record_index":"117313","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121241009:0":{"text":"생명을 다한 빛나는 꽃은 땅으로 돌아가서 다시 이블플라워로 탄생하게 돼. 이게 바로 생명의 순환이지.","source_cn":"荧荧花死亡后，身体也将回归大地，再次生出魔花。这便是生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA731B71210076EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121241010:0":{"text":"조금 어렵네... \n땅으로 돌아간다는 게 뭐지? 생명의 순환은 또 뭐고?","source_cn":"我好像没听懂。\\n回归大地是什么？生命的循环又是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D28D8473874C245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121241011:0":{"text":"그럼, 이해할 필요 없어. 지금은 몸이 안 좋아서 머리도 안 돌아갈 거야. 우선 우리랑 돌아가자.","source_cn":"那就不要理解了，你现在身体不好嘛，脑子也会跟不上的，先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x004996E287629C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121241012:0":{"text":"하지만, 알고 싶어.","source_cn":"可是，我想知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E1AB4D9EC3645F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121241013:0":{"text":"얘 왜 이렇게 고집이야...\n어쩔 수 없지. 기회가 되면 내가 차근차근 이야기해 줄게.","source_cn":"真是任性……\\n没办法，有机会的话，我再慢慢讲给你听吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0717354CB2852523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121241014:0":{"text":"걱정 마, 난 약속을 진짜 잘 지킨다고! 약속했으니, 꼭 지킬게.","source_cn":"放心，我可是个很守信用的人。既然答应你了，我一定会做到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB7DF4EC774E28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index